{
  "note": "Wave D lane vbt (lanes/vbt.rs, lanes/vbt/{store,execute}.rs): the /vbt page and its JSON on the bed's real vb_ rows at clocks on the Friday, on the unexpired MORNING plan 69 (Wed 21 Oct 09:10, built 09:00, expires 09:30) and after it lapsed; every refusal of POST /vbt/execute (422/400/404/410/409); three PLACE_LIMIT confirms of plan 69 through the sleeve's own gateway in DRY_RUN (VBT_EXECUTION_ENABLED=false), each a LIMIT at the signal close, a simulated fill, a position and its GTT stop; the scan contract (202, 409, the older /vbt/rescan's accepted=false, status by id, 404). VBT has no auto-execute flag. The replay Kite must record no order or GTT call.",
